// PlexSpaces polyglot host ABI — redirect.
//
// The flat "host" interface has been split into 9 focused namespaced interfaces.
// See: host-logging.wit, host-actor.wit, host-kv.wit, host-ts.wit,
//      host-locks.wit, host-blob.wit, host-pool.wit, host-shard.wit, host-http.wit
//
// The guest actor interface (implemented by WASM actors) is in deployable-actor.wit.
// world.wit defines the actor-world that ties host imports and actor exports together.
